# DexKit blog banner images

When the user asks for a **blog image**, **OG image**, **social banner**, or **tweet image** for dexkit.com articles:

## Do not

- Use raw AI image generation alone (dark navy, blockchain grids, 3D phones, teal/cyan themes).
- Invent a new visual style per post.
- Skip the DexKit logo in the top-left.
- Use backgrounds that are not the brand purple → orange gradient.

## Brand spec (1200×630 PNG)

| Element | Spec |
|--------|------|
| Size | **1200×630** (OG / Twitter large card) |
| Background | Diagonal gradient: `#5F25E0` (top-left) → `#8B2FC9` (mid) → `#F15A24` (bottom-right) |
| Logo | `public/imgs/dexkit-logo-white-o-o.svg` — top-left (~48px from edges, ~200px wide). Orange D + white “DexKit” wordmark (same as other posts). |
| Headline | Large white sans-serif; key phrase in **solid `#F24023` rounded rectangle** |
| Subtitle | White, smaller, below headline |
| Footer | `dexkit.com` in a pill: transparent fill, **`#F24023` border**, white text, bottom-left |
| Optional | Light white node-network graphic bottom-right; simple flat white icon on the right (no 3D mockups) |

**Reference banners (match these):**

- `public/blog-images/dexkit-web3-widgets.png`
- `public/blog-images/On-chain-app-blog.png`

## How to produce the image

1. **Prefer** `scripts/compose-blog-banner.mjs` (Sharp + SVG): gradient, official logo, text layers.
2. Example:

```bash
node scripts/compose-blog-banner.mjs \
  --out my-post-slug.png \
  --line1 "Introducing" \
  --highlight "Web3 Widgets" \
  --subtitle "Embed swaps and drops on any site" \
  --tagline "DexAppBuilder · No Code" \
  --iconLabel "ERC-20"
```
3. Save as `public/blog-images/{slug-or-topic}.png` (kebab-case, descriptive).
4. Set `imageUrl: /blog-images/{filename}.png` in frontmatter for **EN, PT, and ES** (required — see `.cursor/rules/dexkit-blog-content.mdc`).

## After creating the image

- Do not rely on `GenerateImage` unless compositing on top of the brand template or using reference images above; if used, post-process with the compose script or Sharp + logo SVG.
- Hard-refresh / redeploy dexkit-js-2024 for CDN cache.

## Example layout

```
[DexKit logo]                                    [optional icon]
Deploy
[ Token Allowance Drop ]  ← orange box
ERC-20 Presale & Claim Guide
DexAppBuilder · No Code
[ dexkit.com ]
```
